  "description": "A lightweight EF Core base library that adds automatic audit trails (CreatedBy/CreatedAt/ModifiedBy/ModifiedAt), soft delete, and paged/query helpers directly on DbSet<T> - no repository layer required. Includes an opt-in, zero-boilerplate caching layer built on HybridCache: enable one setting and GetAllAsync/GetPagedAsync/FindOneAsync are transparently cached and automatically invalidated on save, with optional Redis backing for multi-instance consistency. Developed and maintained by AgileTech.",
